## Why This Question Is Asked

This question tests end-to-end design skills for complex data workflows involving sensitive data, combining multiple AWS AI services, data protection mechanisms, and cost controls.

## Key Concepts

- Textract AnalyzeDocument for structured data extraction from forms and tables
- Comprehend for document classification and PII entity detection
- Layout-preserving redaction techniques
- Event-driven orchestration using Step Functions
- Dual-output storage in S3 with DynamoDB indexing
- IAM least privilege principles, KMS encryption, dead-letter queues, retry logic, and cost controls

## Code Example

```json
{
  "Comment": "State machine outline",
  "StartAt": "Ingest",
  "States": {
    "Ingest": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke",
      "Parameters": {
        "FunctionName": "S3TriggerLambda"
      },
      "Next": "TextractAnalysis"
    },
    "TextractAnalysis": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::aws-sdk:textract/analyzeDocument",
      "Parameters": {
        "Document": {
          "S3Object": {
            "Bucket.$": "$.bucket",
            "Name.$": "$.key"
          }
        },
        "FeatureTypes": ["FORMS", "TABLES"]
      },
      "Next": "ComprehendClassification"
    },
    "ComprehendClassification": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::aws-sdk:comprehend:classifyDocument",
      "Parameters": {
        "EndpointArn": "arn:aws:comprehend:region:account:endpoint/document-classifier",
        "Text": "$($.extractedText)"
      },
      "Next": "RedactPII"
    },
    "RedactPII": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke",
