## Architecture Considerations

| Component | Implementation |
|-----------|----------------|
| **Trigger** | S3 Event Notification → Lambda → Step Functions |
| **Textract** | AnalyzeDocument with FORMS and TABLES feature types |
| **Comprehend** | Custom classifier for doc type + DetectPIIEntities |
| **Redaction** | Lambda using PDF library to mask coordinates |
| **Storage** | Separate buckets for original and redacted with KMS encryption |
| **Indexing** | DynamoDB with contractId as partition key |
| **Error Handling** | Try-catch per state, DLQ for failed executions |
| **Cost Control** | S3 lifecycle policies, CloudWatch budgets, payload limits |
| **Data Residency** | Regional endpoints, bucket policies enforcing region |
| **IAM** | Role-based access with least privilege scope |

